## 4. English summary

This project uses **split licensing**:

- **Source code**: MIT License (see §1).
- **Character art, animation data (frame sequences or legacy Spine) and audio under `assets/characters/`**:
  CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International), scoped per pack by that
  pack's `LICENSE` and `ATTRIBUTION` files.

This repository is the **license distribution point** of the DSH Pets ecosystem. The code inherits
from [bloodarea/dsh-pets](https://github.com/bloodarea/dsh-pets) (MIT), which in turn derives portions
from [zuodazuoqiang001/dsh-pet](https://github.com/zuodazuoqiang001/dsh-pet) (MIT). The runtime
repository will reference this license text instead of maintaining its own copy.

The DeepSeek pack derives from the whale-girl character designed by 上善无形 / 上善 and the DeepSeek
personification redesign by ZipZipPipe. Reuse requires full attribution, an indication of changes,
**non-commercial** use only, and ShareAlike licensing of derivative contributions.

Free distribution on GitHub Releases or npm does **not** grant commercial rights. This project
grants no rights it does not hold; every asset's upstream license must be verified per asset.
This is an unofficial fan project with no affiliation to DeepSeek or any model provider.
